===============================
REUSED AND DERIVATIVE MATERIALS
===============================

The following assets are derived from or reused core Minetest Game assets.
Source repository: https://github.com/luanti-org/minetest_game

fire_logs_burning.png
=====================
- Contains direct usage of "fire_basic_flame_animated.png" from the 'fire' mod.
- Original Authors: Minetest Game Contributors
- Original License: CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/)
- This asset is distributed under the identical CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported license.

fire_logs.png
=============
- This asset is a custom derivative built from "default_aspen_tree.png" and
  "default_aspen_tree_top.png" from the 'default' mod.
- Original Author: sofar
- Modifications: Cut, rearranged, and edited into a custom pile log layout.
- Original License: CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/)
- This derivative is distributed under the identical CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported license.

on_punch sounds
===============
- These assets are used directly to light and extinguish the fire:
  - fire_flint_and_steel.ogg
  - fire_extinguish_flame.ogg
- Original Authors: Minetest Game Contributors
- Original License: CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/)
- These assets are distributed under the identical CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported license.
